ok nae air, nae tune: the stops only wheeze afore the compressor
ok the sheet music shows the tune; the compressor starts the air once, an runs
ok a wrang stop plays a sour chord an resets the tune, an the stops it lit
ok a sour red starts the tune at one; red, red, gold, blue, green opens the crypt door
ok presses efter the crypt opens change naething
